Feature: Ethereum Culture and Philosophy
  As a global decentralized ledger manifold
  Ethereum maintains jurisdictional neutrality at the execution layer while compliance constraints are localized to regional frontends

  Scenario: Jurisdictional Neutrality and Frontend Compliance
    Given a validator block is propagated to the global execution layer
    When the transaction content conflicts with a local jurisdiction's regulatory framework
    Then the global consensus and execution layer must not censor or modify the transaction state
    And any necessary regional regulatory filtering must be performed by local Web2 gateway and frontend providers
